  - id: ch5-ex-01
    type: single-choice
    lessonId: 
    topic: 
    difficulty: 2
    tags: []
    source: GT 2021, tr. 169
    chapterId: tthcm-ch5
    prompt: "M\u1EE5c ti\xEAu v\u1EC1 t\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng c\u1EE7a Ch\u01B0\u01A1ng 5 l\xE0 g\xEC?"
    explanation: "\u0110\xF3 l\xE0 m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu \"V\u1EC1 t\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng\"."
    promptVN: "M\u1EE5c ti\xEAu v\u1EC1 t\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng c\u1EE7a Ch\u01B0\u01A1ng 5 l\xE0 g\xEC?"
    explanationVN: "\u0110\xF3 l\xE0 m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu \"V\u1EC1 t\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng\"."
    options:
    - id: A
      text: "C\u1EE7ng c\u1ED1 ni\u1EC1m tin v\xE0o kh\u1ED1i \u0111\u1EA1i \u0111o\xE0n k\u1EBFt to\xE0n d\xE2n t\u1ED9c, \u0111o\xE0n k\u1EBFt qu\u1ED1c t\u1EBF v\xE0 s\u1EF1 k\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh d\xE2n t\u1ED9c v\u1EDBi s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh th\u1EDDi \u0111\u1EA1i trong s\u1EF1 nghi\u1EC7p \u0111\u1ED5i m\u1EDBi"
      textVN: "C\u1EE7ng c\u1ED1 ni\u1EC1m tin v\xE0o kh\u1ED1i \u0111\u1EA1i \u0111o\xE0n k\u1EBFt to\xE0n d\xE2n t\u1ED9c, \u0111o\xE0n k\u1EBFt qu\u1ED1c t\u1EBF v\xE0 s\u1EF1 k\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh d\xE2n t\u1ED9c v\u1EDBi s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh th\u1EDDi \u0111\u1EA1i trong s\u1EF1 nghi\u1EC7p \u0111\u1ED5i m\u1EDBi"
      side: 
    - id: B
      text: "Xem nh\u1EB9 \u0111o\xE0n k\u1EBFt"
      textVN: "Xem nh\u1EB9 \u0111o\xE0n k\u1EBFt"
      side: 
    - id: C
      text: "B\u1ECF qua h\u1ED9i nh\u1EADp"
      textVN: "B\u1ECF qua h\u1ED9i nh\u1EADp"
      side: 
    - id: D
      text: "Ch\u1EC9 tin n\u1ED9i l\u1EF1c"
      textVN: "Ch\u1EC9 tin n\u1ED9i l\u1EF1c"
      side: 
    correctOptionIds:
    - A
  - id: ch5-ex-02
    type: true-false
    lessonId: 
    topic: 
    difficulty: 2
    tags: []
    source: GT 2021, tr. 190-191
    chapterId: tthcm-ch5
    prompt: "Nh\u1EADn \u0111\u1ECBnh: \u0110o\xE0n k\u1EBFt qu\u1ED1c t\u1EBF trong t\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh l\xE0 v\u1EA5n \u0111\u1EC1 c\xF3 t\xEDnh nguy\xEAn t\u1EAFc, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i s\xE1ch l\u01B0\u1EE3c nh\u1EA5t th\u1EDDi."
    explanation: "Gi\xE1o tr\xECnh n\xEAu \u0111o\xE0n k\u1EBFt qu\u1ED1c t\u1EBF kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 v\u1EA5n \u0111\u1EC1 s\xE1ch l\u01B0\u1EE3c, m\u1ED9t th\u1EE7 \u0111o\u1EA1n ch\xEDnh tr\u1ECB nh\u1EA5t th\u1EDDi m\xE0 l\xE0 v\u1EA5n \u0111\u1EC1 c\xF3 t\xEDnh nguy\xEAn t\u1EAFc."
    promptVN: "Nh\u1EADn \u0111\u1ECBnh: \u0110o\xE0n k\u1EBFt qu\u1ED1c t\u1EBF trong t\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh l\xE0 v\u1EA5n \u0111\u1EC1 c\xF3 t\xEDnh nguy\xEAn t\u1EAFc, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i s\xE1ch l\u01B0\u1EE3c nh\u1EA5t th\u1EDDi."
    explanationVN: "Gi\xE1o tr\xECnh n\xEAu \u0111o\xE0n k\u1EBFt qu\u1ED1c t\u1EBF kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 v\u1EA5n \u0111\u1EC1 s\xE1ch l\u01B0\u1EE3c, m\u1ED9t th\u1EE7 \u0111o\u1EA1n ch\xEDnh tr\u1ECB nh\u1EA5t th\u1EDDi m\xE0 l\xE0 v\u1EA5n \u0111\u1EC1 c\xF3 t\xEDnh nguy\xEAn t\u1EAFc."
