    prompt: "\u0110\u1EA1i \u0111o\xE0n k\u1EBFt to\xE0n d\xE2n t\u1ED9c l\xE0 g\xEC \u0111\u1ED1i v\u1EDBi c\xE1ch m\u1EA1ng theo H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh?"
    explanation: "\u0110\xE2y l\xE0 ti\xEAu \u0111\u1EC1 m\u1EE5c 1a c\u1EE7a Ch\u01B0\u01A1ng 5."
    promptVN: "\u0110\u1EA1i \u0111o\xE0n k\u1EBFt to\xE0n d\xE2n t\u1ED9c l\xE0 g\xEC \u0111\u1ED1i v\u1EDBi c\xE1ch m\u1EA1ng theo H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh?"
